								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=484.msg8027#msg8027">Re: the nation of islam, the good and the bad</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #30 on:</b> December 12, 2006, 12:43:37 am &#187;</div></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
