									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=484.msg8099#msg8099">Re: the nation of islam, the good and the bad</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #31 on:</b> December 12, 2006, 03:22:19 pm &#187;</div></td>
